# Hotfoot Gnome {2}{R} 3/1: "{T}: Another target creature gains haste until end of turn." On turn 1 the Gnome (haste itself) comes
# in with Memnite beside it. The Gnome cannot be its own target (the ability is refused naming it, "another"), but it can name
# Memnite: Memnite gains haste, attacks the turn it came, and Bot2 takes 1. The Gnome is tapped by the cost.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hotfoot Gnome
Memnite
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

